  <item>
    <title>情侣对谈｜恋爱五年是这样吵架、分钱的，对结婚的看法，维持长期关系的方法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69afc4bc449a1265b44b2ecd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69afc4bc449a1265b44b2ecd</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>恋爱五周年，录了我和小陈的第二期情侣Q&amp;A，上一期已经是四年前了，好快！感谢大家的提问，我们边回答，边回看这五年的相处和变化，聊得很开心～哪怕是一点，也希望可以给你们一些帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一、怎么认识/确认关系的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 怎么认识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 怎么告白的</span></p><span></span><p><span>二、怎么吵架/磨合/化解分歧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 有矛盾吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a> 怎么处理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 怎么沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 怎么磨合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 最严重的一次吵架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 冷战怎么破冰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 观点或生活习惯冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span>三、长期关系怎么维持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a> 时间长了还会心动吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 如何保持新鲜感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 关系中的个体性</span></p><span></span><p><span>四、金钱与生活分工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> 消费分配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 消费观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 家务分配</span></p><span></span><p><span>五、未来规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 如何看待结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 什么程度会结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a> 如何看待生育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">18:41</a> 如何确定一直走下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 如何融入对方家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> 父母催婚怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span>六、其他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a> 五年里彼此最大的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 难忘的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> 双方相似还是互补</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1559">25:59</a> 小陈眼中的小蝶</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈喽大家，这里是小蝶。本科北大中文，硕士上交新闻，大厂工作一年后裸辞。内容创作者（视频、文章、播客等），全网都叫“小蝶今天吃饱了”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>bilibili：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/38060523" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/38060523"><span>小蝶今天吃饱了</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/609646fd0000000001003f7f?xsec_token=YBm5zxXtNADsnUYITeUh8TMFcEBbuo4dsrMV7xz2n8Dl0=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=609646fd0000000001003f7f&amp;apptime=1735901224&amp;share_id=226a58f070dd462bb1cd6a0ef6a5cca2" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/609646fd0000000001003f7f?xsec_token=YBm5zxXtNADsnUYITeUh8TMFcEBbuo4dsrMV7xz2n8Dl0=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=609646fd0000000001003f7f&amp;apptime=1735901224&amp;share_id=226a58f070dd462bb1cd6a0ef6a5cca2"><span>小蝶今天吃饱了</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NQU-12YCC0zDfgPmKUN6gA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NQU-12YCC0zDfgPmKUN6gA"><span>小蝶今天吃饱了</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:diannddd