    <guid isPermaLink="false">6283c3d1ad3e85ac09d6c625</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 May 2022 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和小陈聊了聊封在家的这段时间，得出结论：想去海边</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>等一个自然而然的晴天，我想要带你去海边</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小陈，小蝶的男朋友，爱看电影的浪漫理科男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 4月1日之前的居家状态与现状（5月中旬）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 什么时候开始状态变糟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a> 为什么变极度丧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a> </span></span><span>怎么振作起来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> </span></span><span>面对状态很差的伴侣该怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 推荐一些剧和电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 想去海边</span></p><span></span><p><span>【推荐的剧和电影】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我的解放日志》（2022）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《朱诺》（2007）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《春天的故事》（1990）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《夏天的故事》（1996）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期节目中的音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《想去海边》-夏日入侵企画</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于小蝶】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>97双子女</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在B站发视频</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在微博生闷气</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在小红书发照片</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在公众号写东西</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在家吃小陈做的饭</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在网上和大家一起成长</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
